        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Caricia\n- People: Leo Dan\n- Companies: XM Satellite Radio, DirecTV\n- Places: Villa Atamisqui, Santiago del Estero Province\n\nFacts:\n- Leo Dan, whose birth name is Leopoldo Dante Tévez, was born on June 1, 1942.\n- Leo Dan is an Argentine composer and singer from Villa Atamisqui in Santiago del Estero Province.\n- Caricia was a radio station on XM Satellite Radio channel 93 and DirecTV channel 875.\n- Caricia was available only to DirecTV subscribers who subscribed to the Spanish-language programming package.",
